{
  "_about": "WS-17 EM-T14b-1, email_app_master_plan.md 13.9.2. Each case is a quote and the amount and the currency that parse_amount must read from it. A null amount means no amount. 'reason' names why, when the module gives a reason. WS-43y1a parses numbers too, so a later slice points its parser at this file.",
